<!-- Android Material 3 Expressive theme; pinned source and licenses in NOTICE.md.
     Inherited WinUI template-contract resources are separate merged dictionaries.
     Material role, typography and metric overrides are direct resources, so they
     take precedence without flattening duplicate legacy keys into one dictionary.

     Each inherited resource document is merged (MergeResourceInclude) into a merged
     dictionary of its own, so that it is a unit of the compiled theme that an
     application can leave out (#568, docs/porting/theme-trimming.md), while every
     document stays a separate dictionary in the same order as before: a
     {StaticResource} in one of them still looks in its own document first and then
     in this dictionary, where the Material overrides and the color schemes win. -->
